	)
	(text "J7 = link to the Pi Zero 2. 1x10 2.54 mm header; a 10-way single-row Dupont ribbon goes to the\nEVEN row of the Pi header, pins 2-20, one-to-one (J7 pin n = Pi pin 2n).\n  J7 1, 2     Pi 2, 4       5V   - the board powers the Pi (bypasses the Pi micro-USB polyfuse)\n  J7 3, 7, 10 Pi 6, 14, 20  GND\n  J7 4        Pi 8  GPIO14 TXD  -> UART2 -> ESP32 U0RXD (IO3)\n  J7 5        Pi 10 GPIO15 RXD  <- UART1 <- ESP32 U0TXD (IO1)\n  J7 6        Pi 12 GPIO18 = DTR    J7 8  Pi 16 GPIO23 = RTS\n  J7 9        Pi 18 GPIO24, spare, not connected. Pi 3V3 (pin 1) is NOT connected.\nQ2/Q3 auto-program, same logic as the old CH340 DTR/RTS: EN low only when RTS=0 and DTR=1;\nIO0 low only when DTR=0 and RTS=1. Both equal (incl. the Pi default pull-downs at boot) = no effect.\nFlash from the Pi: hold IO0 low via the GPIOs, pulse EN, then esptool --before no_reset.\nThe camera plugs into the Pi Zero 2 USB port (no USB on this board)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5cfd355d-528d-4b80-bad5-1116d72eadfb")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
